scanbd (1.5.1+welland1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Welland patched build of scanbd 1.5.1 (Debian 1.5.1-7
    sources, re-homed as a native package).
  * Fix physical scanner button presses never firing an action with the
    SANE pixma backend (Canon PIXMA / CanoScan, e.g. LiDE 400): the poll
    loop now SET_VALUEs the backend's "button-update" option to refresh
    the cached button/event state before reading the monitored options.

 -- Tim 'mithro' Ansell <me@mith.ro>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 11:59:47 +0930
